                    &lt;% }); %&gt;&lt;/script&gt; &lt;div class=&quot;main-foot&quot; t=&quot;com.CopyRight&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;div id=&quot;timeout_logout&quot; class=&quot;u-dialog fn-width436&quot;&gt; &lt;div class=&quot;u-dialog-head&quot;&gt; &lt;h1 t=&quot;com.Prompt&quot;&gt;&lt;/h1&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class=&quot;u-dialog-content fn-clear fn-textcenter&quot;&gt; &lt;i class=&quot;i-dialog-warn&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt; &lt;span t=&quot;com.ErrorAuthorizeReloginTip&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class=&quot;u-dialog-foot&quot;&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;u-button&quot; data-action=&quot;confirm&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; t=&quot;com.Ok&quot;&gt;  &lt;/a&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;iframe id=&quot;_download&quot; src=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div id=&quot;cloudDialog&quot; class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;position:absolute;border-color:#4c4c4c;top:50%;margin-top:-110px;width:100%;display:none;z-index:100000&quot;&gt; &lt;div class=&quot;ui-dialog&quot; style=&quot;position:relative;margin:auto;top:0px;display:block&quot;&gt; &lt;div class=&quot;ui-form-item&quot; style=&quot;text-align:left; padding:10px;color:red&quot;&gt;!! CAUTION !!&lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class=&quot;ui-form-item&quot; style=&quot;text-align:left; padding:10px&quot;&gt; An important security update is available. Please carefully read the following before proceeding. In order for the firmware update to be effective, you MUST restore the default settings on your camera after the update is complete. Restoring your camera to default settings will rewrite your current settings. To save your current settings, please click CANCEL and follow our tutorial for saving your settings at this link: &lt;a href=&quot;www.amcrest.com/camera-settings&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;color:blue&quot;&gt;www.amcrest.com/camera-settings&lt;/a&gt;. To proceed with updating your firmware, click UPDATE below to download and install the firmware. Once complete, navigate to Setup &gt; System &gt; Default Settings, and click the “Restore To Default Settings” button to enable the firmware. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class=&quot;ui-form-item&quot;&gt; &lt;label class=&quot;ui-label fn-padl20&quot; t=&quot;com.CloudCurVer&quot;&gt;Current Version&lt;/label&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;ui-text&quot; id=&quot;cloud_curVer&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class=&quot;ui-form-item&quot;&gt; &lt;label class=&quot;ui-label fn-padl20&quot; t=&quot;com.CloudUpVer&quot;&gt;Upgrade Version&lt;/label&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;ui-text&quot; id=&quot;cloud_upVer&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class=&quot;ui-button-box&quot;&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;ui-button fn-marl30&quot; id=&quot;cloud_updata&quot; t=&quot;SysUpdate&quot;&gt;Update&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;ui-button&quot; id=&quot;cloud_cancel&quot; t=&quot;com.Cancel&quot;&gt;Cancel&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div id=&quot;upgradeDialog&quot; class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;position:absolute;top:50%;margin-top:-110px;width:100%;display:none;z-index:10010&quot;&gt; &lt;div class=&quot;ui-dialog&quot; style=&quot;position:relative;margin:auto;top:0px;display:block&quot;&gt; &lt;div class=&quot;ui-form-item&quot; style=&quot;text-align:left; padding:10px&quot;&gt; Please note there is an important security firmware upgrade available for your device. Due to the urgent nature of this upgrade, your device will be upgraded automatically. Please do not disconnect the power or network. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class=&quot;ui-button-box&quot;&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;ui-button fn-marl30&quot; id=&quot;go_updata&quot; t=&quot;com.Ok&quot;&gt;OK&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;script src=&quot;jsBase/lib/md5.js?version=@WebVersion@&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt; &lt;script src=&quot;jsBase/lib/base64.js?