  IP address the DHCP server would attribute us : 192.168.50.137
  DHCP server(s) identifier : 192.168.50.1
  Netmask : 255.255.255.0
  Router : 192.168.50.1
  Domain name server(s) : 192.168.50.1
  Domain name : localdomain

</plugin_output>
</ReportItem>
