<ReportItem port="22" svc_name="ssh" protocol="tcp" severity="0" pluginID="39520" pluginName="Backported Security Patch Detection (SSH)" pluginFamily="General">
<description>Security patches may have been &apos;backported&apos; to the remote SSH server without changing its version number. 

Banner-based checks have been disabled to avoid false positives. 

