<ReportItem port="9" svc_name="discard" protocol="tcp" severity="0" pluginID="11367" pluginName="Discard Service Detection" pluginFamily="Service detection">
<description>The remote host is running a &apos;discard&apos; service.  This service typically sets up a listening socket and will ignore all the data which it receives. 

This service is unused these days, so it is advised that you disable it.</description>
