	TLS_RSA_WITH_AES_256_GCM_SHA384
	TLS_ECDHE_RSA_WITH_CHACHA20_POLY1305_SHA256 with curves: 
		x25519, secp384r1 or secp256r1
	TLS_RSA_WITH_AES_128_GCM_SHA256

The TLS service on port 10101 offers these ciphers vulnerable to Shor&apos;s:
