	TLS_CK_DHE_RSA_WITH_AES_256_CBC_SHA with curves: 
		ffdhe2048, ffdhe3072, ffdhe4096, ffdhe6144 or ffdhe8192
	TLS_RSA_WITH_AES_256_GCM_SHA384
