<description>The version of Grafana installed on the remote host is 8.0.x through 11.6.x prior to 11.6.14, 12.0.x through 12.1.x prior to 12.1.10, 12.2.x prior to 12.2.8, 12.3.x prior to 12.3.6, or 12.4.x prior to 12.4.2. It is, therefore, affected by a denial of service vulnerability:

