<plugin_publication_date>2014/07/11</plugin_publication_date>
<plugin_type>remote</plugin_type>
<product_coverage>Low</product_coverage>
<risk_factor>Medium</risk_factor>
<script_version>1.9</script_version>
<see_also>http://www.nessus.org/u?8b551b5c</see_also>
<solution>Disable the SNMP service on the remote host if you do not use it.
Otherwise, restrict and monitor access to this service, and consider changing the default &apos;public&apos; community string.</solution>
<synopsis>The remote SNMP daemon is affected by a vulnerability that allows a reflected distributed denial of service attack.</synopsis>
