                            &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://tomcat.apache.org/lists.html#taglibs-user&quot;&gt;taglibs-user&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
                                User support and discussion for &lt;a href=&quot;http://tomcat.apache.org/taglibs/&quot;&gt;Apache Taglibs&lt;/a&gt;
