<ReportItem port="8082" svc_name="www" protocol="tcp" severity="0" pluginID="24260" pluginName="HyperText Transfer Protocol (HTTP) Information" pluginFamily="Web Servers">
<asset_inventory>True</asset_inventory>
<description>This test gives some information about the remote HTTP protocol - the version used, whether HTTP Keep-Alive is enabled, etc... 

This test is informational only and does not denote any security problem.</description>
