<ReportItem port="8081" svc_name="www" protocol="tcp" severity="1" pluginID="178943" pluginName="Apache Tomcat SEoL (8.5.x)" pluginFamily="Web Servers">
<cpe>cpe:/a:apache:tomcat:8</cpe>
<description>According to its version, Apache Tomcat is 8.5.x. It is, therefore, no longer maintained by its vendor or provider.

Lack of support implies that no new security patches for the product will be released by the vendor. As a result, it may contain security vulnerabilities.</description>
<fname>tomcat_8_5_seol.nasl</fname>
<plugin_modification_date>2024/05/06</plugin_modification_date>
<plugin_name>Apache Tomcat SEoL (8.5.x)</plugin_name>
<plugin_publication_date>2023/07/27</plugin_publication_date>
<plugin_type>combined</plugin_type>
<risk_factor>Low</risk_factor>
<script_version>1.3</script_version>
<see_also>https://tomcat.apache.org/tomcat-85-eol.html</see_also>
<seol_date>2024/03/31</seol_date>
<solution>Upgrade to a version of Apache Tomcat that is currently supported.</solution>
<synopsis>An unsupported version of Apache Tomcat is installed on the remote host.</synopsis>
<unsupported_by_vendor>true</unsupported_by_vendor>
<plugin_output>
  URL                                    : http://10.114.132.22:8081/
  Installed version                      : 8.5.5
  Security End of Life                   : March 31, 2024
  Time since Security End of Life (Est.) : &gt;= 2 years
</plugin_output>
</ReportItem>
<ReportItem port="8081" svc_name="www" protocol="tcp" severity="2" pluginID="173256" pluginName="Apache Tomcat 8.5.0 &lt; 8.5.86" pluginFamily="Web Servers">
<age_of_vuln>730 days +</age_of_vuln>
<agent>all</agent>
<cpe>cpe:/a:apache:tomcat:8</cpe>
<cve>CVE-2023-28708</cve>
<cvss3_base_score>4.3</cvss3_base_score>
<cvss3_temporal_score>3.8</cvss3_temporal_score>
<cvss3_temporal_vector>CVSS:3.0/E:U/RL:O/RC:C</cvss3_temporal_vector>
<cvss3_vector>CVSS:3.0/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:U/C:L/I:N/A:N</cvss3_vector>
<cvssV3_impactScore>1.4</cvssV3_impactScore>
<cvss_base_score>5.0</cvss_base_score>
