https://bz.apache.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=66471
http://www.nessus.org/u?e6187e29</see_also>
<solution>Upgrade to Apache Tomcat version 8.5.86 or later.</solution>
<stig_severity>I</stig_severity>
