  umac-64-etm@openssh.com
  umac-64@openssh.com

The server supports the following options for server_host_key_algorithms : 

  ecdsa-sha2-nistp256
  rsa-sha2-256
  rsa-sha2-512
  ssh-ed25519

The server supports the following options for encryption_algorithms_client_to_server : 

