<product_coverage>Low</product_coverage>
<risk_factor>Medium</risk_factor>
<script_version>1.34</script_version>
<see_also>http://www.nessus.org/u?8033da0d</see_also>
<solution>- Force the use of SSL as a transport layer for this service if supported, or/and

- On Microsoft Windows operating systems, select the &apos;Allow connections only from computers running Remote  Desktop with Network Level Authentication&apos; setting if it is available.</solution>
<synopsis>It may be possible to get access to the remote host.</synopsis>
